    dict(key='17-act-4-figure', kind='figure', title='Three small leaks',
         body='small_leaks',
         narration="Fourth demo: three small leaks. [[slnc 400]] On the left, the server header. [[slnc 300]] The shipped store names its product and its exact version, in every reply. [[slnc 300]] An attacker looks up the advisories for that version. [[slnc 300]] The hardened store sends nothing. [[slnc 700]] In the middle, the trace method. [[slnc 300]] We send it with the customer's session cookie. [[slnc 300]] The shipped store echoes the request back, cookie included. [[slnc 300]] A script that can send trace can read a cookie it was never meant to see. [[slnc 300]] The hardened store refuses: four oh five. [[slnc 700]] On the right, the settings file's mode. [[slnc 300]] Three letters for the owner, three for the group, three for everyone else. [[slnc 300]] With r in the group and others, any user on the machine can read the admin secret. [[slnc 300]] With dashes, nobody else can."),
